<!-- ============ 03 · PRODUCTION REAL-TIME SYSTEMS ============ -->
<section class="sys no-media reveal" id="sys">
  <div class="sec-num">03</div>
  <h3 class="stitle" data-i18n="sys_stitle">Production Real-Time Systems</h3>
  <p class="ssub" data-i18n="sys_ssub">Built and optimized production real-time systems for large-scale cross-platform online products.</p>
  <p class="lead" data-i18n="sys_lead">My work covered multiplayer networking, dedicated servers, RPC, performance and memory optimization, multi-threading, Android/iOS/PC deployment, crash analysis and regression testing, and cross-team module integration.</p>
  <ul class="bullets">
    <li data-i18n="sys_b1">Real-time multiplayer networking &amp; sync</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b2">Dedicated Server &amp; RPC / UDP</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b3">Performance &amp; memory optimization</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b4">Multi-threading</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b5">Android · iOS · PC deployment</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b6">Crash analysis &amp; regression testing</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b7">Cross-team module integration</li>
    <li data-i18n="sys_b8">Cross-platform toolchains &amp; pipelines</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="note">
    <h4 data-i18n="sys_ctx_h">Project context</h4>
    <p data-i18n="sys_ctx_p1">Fun Party reached 129M+ users within three months of launch. This is a product-level public figure; my responsibilities covered specific systems and modules.</p>
    <p data-i18n="sys_ctx_p2">QQHome integrated Unreal-engine interactive experiences into the QQ platform (500M+ MAU ecosystem).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="note">
    <h4 data-i18n="sys_note_h">Note</h4>
    <p data-i18n="sys_note_p1">These are team-built products; I owned specific modules rather than the whole product.</p>
    <p data-i18n="sys_note_p2">Long-term user of Unreal Engine and C++, with core expertise spanning real-time systems, multiplayer synchronization, network communication, memory and multi-threading optimization, and cross-platform toolchains; plus rendering, animation, physics, character 3C, network protocols, UI, materials, Dedicated Servers, multi-platform adaptation, hot-update, production pipelines, engine modification, AI-assisted development, and multi-module integration and debugging.</p>
  </div>
</section>

